:: StoryInterface
<div id="app"><div id="qf-stage"><div id="qf-bg" class="qf-layer"></div><div id="qf-cg" class="qf-layer"></div><div id="qf-char" class="qf-layer"></div><div id="qf-shade"></div><div id="qf-place" aria-hidden="true"></div><header id="bar" data-passage="Bar"></header><main id="passages"></main><nav id="qf-tools" data-passage="Tools" aria-label="工具栏"></nav><div id="qf-banner" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="qf-fx"></div></div></div>

:: Bar
<div class="bar-in"><button type="button" class="qf-ic" data-qf="prev" aria-label="上一句">‹</button><span class="chap"><<if setup.admin.enabled>>管理 · <</if>><<print setup.chapLabel()>></span><span class="bar-end"><<if setup.admin.enabled>><button type="button" class="qf-txt" data-qf="admin">管理</button><</if>><button type="button" class="qf-ic" data-qf="menu" aria-label="菜单">≡</button></span></div>

:: Tools
<button type="button" data-qf="log">回看</button><button type="button" data-qf="save">存档</button><button type="button" data-qf="fast" aria-pressed="false" title="点击开关快进，长按临时快进；遇选项和结局停止">快进</button><button type="button" data-qf="ends">结局</button><<if !setup.admin.enabled>><button type="button" data-qf="chapters">章节</button><</if>><button type="button" data-qf="music" class="qf-music">音乐</button>

:: Start [title]
<<bgm "bgm/主题">>
<div class="title-screen">
<<if setup.admin.enabled>><p class="admin-badge">管理员试玩 · 独立存档</p><</if>>
<div class="heron" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<p class="kicker">1939 — 1949 · 京城</p>
<h1 class="title">潜伏之京城</h1>
<p class="title-ko" lang="ko">잠복의 경성</p>
<p class="lede">他回到京城，在所有人面前变成了一个亲日派。只有两个人知道，他是地下组织埋得最深的一颗钉子，代号「白鹭」。</p>
<nav class="title-menu">
<<if setup.admin.enabled>><<link "选择章节">><<run setup.admin.open()>><</link>><<else>><<link "选择章节">><<run setup.chapterSelect.open()>><</link>><</if>>
<<link "开始游戏" "h1">><</link>>
<<if setup.hasSave()>><<link "继续上次">><<run setup.continueGame()>><</link>><</if>>
<<link "读取存档">><<run UI.saves()>><</link>>
<<link "结局一览" "结局一览">><</link>>
<<link "音源署名" "音源署名">><</link>>
</nav>
<p class="fine">存档保存在当前浏览器里，可在「存档」中导出为文件。共 <<print setup.ENDINGS.length>> 个结局。</p>
<<if setup.admin.enabled>><p class="fine"><a href="index.html">退出管理，返回正式版</a>。本入口是公开的试玩调试工具，不是账号权限后台。</p><</if>>
</div>

:: 结局一览 [gallery]
<header class="hua-head"><span class="no">结局一览</span><span class="tt">走过的路，会在这里留下名字</span></header>
<<print setup.galleryHTML()>>
<nav class="after"><<link "返回">><<run Engine.backward()>><</link>><<link "回到标题">><<run setup.toTitle()>><</link>></nav>

:: 音源署名 [credits]
<header class="hua-head"><span class="no">音源署名</span><span class="tt">声音的来处</span></header>
<p class="fine">配乐包含原创采样编排与授权录音剪辑；部分音效为拟声或物理建模，并非年代档案实录。以下列出各文件的音源、作者与许可；完整处理说明见 <a href="assets/AUDIO_LICENSES.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener">音源许可清单</a>。</p>
<<audioCredits>>
<nav class="after"><<link "返回">><<run Engine.backward()>><</link>><<link "回到标题">><<run setup.toTitle()>><</link>></nav>
